## Data Dictionary {.smaller}

| Columns | Definition |
|:------------------------------:|:--------------------------------------:|
| `tournament_id` | Code for World Cup and the year |
| `tournament_name` | Full name of WC for that year |
| `year` | Year Played |
| `era` | A bucket of what year it was held in, like 1970s |
| `match_id` | Code for match, two teams in the same match would share this identifier |
| `match_date` | When the match took place |
| `stage_name` | The round, if it was group stage, round of 16, quarter-finals, etc. |
| `group_stage` | Binary, 1 if it was group stage, 0 if it wasn't |
| `knockout_stage` | Binary, 1 if it was knockout stage, 0 if it wasn't |
| `team_id` | Code for the team |
| `team_name` | Team name like "Mexico", "Canada", "Argentina" |
| `opponent_name` | Opposing name like "Soviet Union", "Uruguay", "Argentina" |
| `goals_for` | Goals that the team scored |
| `goals_against` | Goal that the opposing team scored |
| `goal_differential` | Difference between the goals for and against |
| `result` | Win, Lose, or Drew for the team |
| `host` | Binary, if current team on the row was the host nation for the tournament |
| `team_confed` | Team continental confederation (Asia, Europe, South America, etc.) |
| `ref_confed` | Referee continental confederation (Asia, Europe, South America, etc.) |
| `same_confed` | Binary, 1 if the referee and the team confederation matches, else 0 |
| `cards` | How many cards the team has received in the match (yellow and red) |
| `any_card` | Binary, 1 if the team got at least 1 card, else 0 |
| `any_sent_off` | Binary, 1 if the team had at least one player sent off the pitch, else 0 |

